<title>INDONESIA: Indorama says Q1 net up sharply.</title>
<headline>Indorama says Q1 net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>				     (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income			 36.17	vs    20.38</p>
<p>Earnings per share</p>
<p>    (annualised, in rupiah)	 224	 vs     127</p>
<p>    Net sales			 198.56	vs   158.07</p>
<p>    Income from operations	 40.71	vs    22.97</p>
<p>    Other income		    (2.38)	vs   (1.03)</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	     374.66	vs   267.57</p>
<p>Note: The results were unaudited. PT Indo-Rama Synthetics is one of Indonesia's largest integrated polyster and resin manufacturers.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta news room (6221) 384-6364</p>
</text>
